    },
    "That was too short to learn your voice. Read the whole passage, a little closer to the microphone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "錄到的聲音太短，還不足以記住你的聲音。請把整段唸完，並靠近麥克風一點。"
