            "state": "translated",
            "value": "mm2t 已連結。你可以關閉這個分頁，回到 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mm2t knows your voice": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "mm2t 已經認得你的聲音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mm2t listens for these words and spells them your way. It also adds terms it hears in your meetings and the ones you correct in a transcript.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "mm2t 會特別留意這些詞，並照你的寫法寫出來。會議中聽到的專有名詞，以及你在逐字稿裡修正過的詞，也會自動加進來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mm2t needs your permissions and keys before it can take notes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "mm2t 需要先取得權限與 API 金鑰，才能開始記錄會議。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mm2t needs your permissions, your keys and a short reading in your own voice before it can take notes.": {
